{
	chapter.5A165C64EEBA6465.title: "Immersive Aircraft"
	chapter.5D1475FC12734DC3.title: "Dannys Attack on Titan"
	quest.0026145EEC39BE26.quest_desc: ["An advanced, highly maneuverable construction vehicle featuring four propellers strapped to a bamboo frame."]
	quest.0060682E1F8D3961.quest_desc: ["A component related to the Gyroscope system, adding instrumentation or additional stability tuning to your aircraft."]
	quest.022A3FD6207059F6.quest_desc: ["The Cart Titan is one of the Nine Titans, known for its exceptional stamina and its powerful back-mounted cart cannon. Its quadrupedal build gives it great endurance, allowing it to carry heavy cargo across long distances while delivering steady long-range firepower throughout extended battles."]
	quest.022A3FD6207059F6.quest_subtitle: "Cart Titan"
	quest.039E96301798F54E.quest_desc: [
		"A greenish biome which can be found in the dimension of paradis, what makes it unique it’s the light green grass and lots of flowers, you can find Utgard Castle and Reiss Chapel in the biome!"
		"{image:kubejs:block/aot24 width:100 height:70 align:center fit:true}"
	]
	quest.053D98B0B01AABEC.quest_desc: [
		"Cloaks can be really useful when roaming in Paradis"
		"Ingame Features"
		"because the unique ability of these cloaks is that they reduce the titan targeting radius whenever the hood is up and hides your nametag, the cloaks can only be equipped in the head slot providing +2 of armor just for the black and green cloak meanwhile the Royal cloak (No recipe and only obtainable through creative mode or commands for now) adds +4 Armor when wearing it"
	]
	quest.082480FCC46D2A3D.quest_desc: ["The Beast Titan is one of the Nine Titans, known for its unusual animal-like appearance and powerful throwing ability. It possesses great strength and long arms, allowing it to launch objects with devastating accuracy over long distances. When inherited by someone with royal blood, the Beast Titan gains the unique ability to create and control Pure Titans using its spinal fluid and scream."]
	quest.082480FCC46D2A3D.quest_subtitle: "Beast Titan"
	quest.09237F7112133396.quest_desc: [
		"Ice burst stone:"
		""
		" is not that much of a use maybe decoration and it is way different from the next Ice Burst Resource the Ice Burst Stone can be found randomly underground in Paradis"
		"use an Iron Pickaxe to mine it quickly and cheap "
		""
		"Bursting Ice Stone:"
		""
		"The Bursting Ice Stone grows Ice Burst Shard Cluster after some time and you can see that there’s a difference with some kind of X on the block, you can use it to make an Ice Burst Shard Cluster farm, giving Ice Burst Cluster"
		""
		"Ice burst shard and Ice Burst Cluster"
		"For the Ice burst Cluster you will need to mine Ice Burst Shard where it grows from the Bursting Ice Stone and mine It! It’s that simple"
		"{image: width:100 height:100 align:center click_action:none:}"
		"{image:kubejs:block/aot22 width:100 height:60 align:center fit:true click_action:none:}"
	]
	quest.0DE058BE37FD53DB.quest_desc: [
		"In paradis there are walled villages protecting those inside from the Titans."
		"Find and enter one of the districts"
		"{image:kubejs:block/aot28 width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.0DE058BE37FD53DB.title: "Enter the walls"
	quest.110E61861B9B10BF.quest_desc: ["Welcome to Dannys aot with ftb quests "]
	quest.12B23CC91BA227AD.quest_desc: [
		"In said villages are villagers, each village has one villager with a random power. Villagers with these powers will have particles around them. if you are having trouble finding one try making Zeke's glasses"
		"{image:kubejs:block/aot14 width:100 height:100 align:center fit:true}"
	]
	quest.12B23CC91BA227AD.title: "Find a Villager with a power of the 9"
	quest.136F8EBEC1174742.quest_desc: ["Ultrahard leather is necessary when crafting trench coats "]
	quest.1CBFA28236622A9E.quest_desc: [
		"Bloodlines are a fundamental mechanic for the mod and ingame experience, whilst it is random you can check what bloodline did you got with: / daot bloodline check @‌s where you might get the following Bloodlines:"
		""
		"&cEldians/Subjects of Ymir&r"
		""
		"“Descendants of Ymir Fritz, the Eldians are the only people capable of becoming Titans. Their bloodline allows them to inherit Titan powers and connect through the mysterious Paths. Because of this ability, Eldians have been both feared and used as weapons throughout history.”"
		""
		"Eldians are able to get shifting powers by eating a shifter npc/player shifter when being a pure titan when using the spinal fluid syringe"
		""
		""
		"&0Ackerman&r"
		""
		"“A rare and powerful bloodline awakened in moments of extreme danger. Ackermans possess enhanced strength, speed, reflexes, and combat instincts, allowing them to fight far beyond normal human limits. Once awakened, their power grants them near-superhuman combat ability and heightened awareness on the battlefield.”"
		""
		"This bloodline has their own ODM animations and of course a unique ability!"
		""
		"When pressing the awakened power keybind (Y by default)"
		""
		""
		"&6Royal&r"
		""
		"“A rare Eldian lineage tied to the Fritz/Reiss family. Players with Royal Blood possess unique control over Titan spinal fluid. In the mod, they can use their own spinal fluid to transform certain mobs and villagers into Titans, reflecting the special abilities seen in royal-blooded Eldians such as Zeke Yeager.”"
		""
		"Royal blood has the unique ability to use their spinal fluid to inject players with their own spinal fluid and achieving the 100% potential of the beast titan!"
		"(Sneak with a syringe equipped to extract the spinal fluid from yourself)"
		""
		""
		""
		"&1Marleyans&r"
		""
		"“Citizens of Marley and the world’s leading military power. Unlike Eldians, they cannot become Titans but maintain control by weaponizing Titan powers through Eldian Warriors.”"
		""
		"Currently, Marleyans don’t have any special traits aside from the fact that they cannot shift or be injected with spinal fluid."
	]
	quest.1CF7A7D6F33C5991.quest_desc: ["A massive behemoth of copper and steel with 4 seats, a moving turret, and 6 weapon mounts. "]
	quest.1DC0026AEF5C63D1.quest_desc: [
		"“Ultra-Hard Steel Blades are the primary weapons used with ODM gear to fight Titans. Forged from a special ultra-hard steel, these blades are strong enough to cut through Titan flesh, especially at the nape—their only true weak point. Because Titan bodies quickly dull the blades, soldiers carry multiple replacements in their ODM gear and can swap them mid-battle.”"
		""
		"A cool thing about these blades is that you can block by holding M2!"
	]
	quest.2192ECA1414346D4.quest_desc: [
		"“Pure Titans are Eldians who have been transformed into mindless Titans through Titan spinal fluid. Unlike Titan Shifters, they have no intelligence, no control over their actions, and exist only with the instinct to seek and devour humans. They wander endlessly until killed or until they consume a Titan Shifter, which allows them to regain human form and inherit that Titan power.”"
		""
		"Pure titans can only be killed with either odm gear and ultra hard steel blades or thunder spears, normal swords can’t damage them and whenever a player injects themselves with -pure titan fluid- they will instantly shift to a pure titan, becoming on of those mindless monsters without being able to control them"
		"{image:kubejs:block/aot8 width:100 height:100 align:center fit:true}"
	]
	quest.256905BEA8456243.quest_desc: ["Optimizes the engine's mechanics, decreasing fuel consumption by 20%."]
	quest.25D9507EFFE8B92B.quest_desc: ["The Warhammer Titan was one of the Nine Titans. It possessed the ability to create structures out of hardened Titan flesh."]
	quest.25D9507EFFE8B92B.quest_subtitle: "Warhammer Titan"
	quest.26233283A59D7246.quest_desc: ["The Colossal Titan is one of the Nine Titans and is known for its enormous size and destructive power. Standing around 60 meters tall, it can release massive amounts of steam from its body, burning nearby enemies and limiting attacks. Its transformation itself creates a powerful explosion capable of destroying large areas, making it one of the most devastating Titans in existence"]
	quest.26233283A59D7246.quest_subtitle: "Colossal Titan"
	quest.26233283A59D7246.title: "Colossal Titan"
	quest.270A4C90183EC42C.quest_desc: ["Increases engine power by 25% while simultaneously raising fuel demand by 50%."]
	quest.27E4F3BCF490FD7D.quest_desc: ["The Jaw Titan was one of the Nine Titans with a ferociously powerful set of jaws and claws that were able to tear through almost anything. Due to its small size, it was known to be one of the fastest out of the Nine Titans."]
	quest.27E4F3BCF490FD7D.quest_subtitle: "Jaw Titan"
	quest.28DB9D01B3779340.quest_desc: ["Now you can handcuff anyone you want! you just have to M2 someone while looking at them with the handcuffs equipped and if you want to release them just M2 them with the key equipped! also check out the new feature!"]
	quest.29F3EC0E5C9F5EEA.quest_desc: ["Increases the durability of your aircraft, making it more resistant to damage from crashes and combat."]
	quest.2ABA0C30E46C053C.quest_desc: ["Slashes fuel consumption by 75% at the cost of 20% engine power"]
	quest.2CACA4D15859A412.quest_desc: ["The Hardened Iron bamboo can only get obtained when you combine iron bamboo and raw iron on Hardened Furnace"]
	quest.2EF8A6D2071EC3F5.quest_desc: [
		"This structure can be found randomly around Paradis"
		"and it can be used to go to the overworld, just like any other portal, you must jump in there"
		"{image:kubejs:block/aot6 width:100 height:100 align:center fit:true}"
	]
	quest.315016D10B7E387E.quest_desc: ["The Female Titan is one of the Nine Titans, known for its versatility and adaptability in combat. It possesses high mobility, powerful hand-to-hand fighting ability, and the power to harden parts of its body to increase both defense and attack. The Female Titan can also emit a scream that attracts nearby Pure Titans and can manifest abilities similar to other Titans to a limited extent if it consumes parts of them"]
	quest.315016D10B7E387E.quest_subtitle: "Female Titan"
	quest.34838EDB402D89A4.quest_desc: ["Syringes are necessary if you want to become a shifter since it’s the only way to get pure titan spinal when near a pure titan and inject it to the player and become a pure titan and necessary to obtain a shifter titan"]
	quest.3630598682A2EB8B.quest_desc: ["A crucial mechanical component made of copper and a furnace, necessary to generate steam or power."]
	quest.36BA2F0988571038.quest_desc: ["The opposite of the Eco Engine — boosts engine power by 40% at the cost of 30% more fuel. Great when you need maximum performance."]
	quest.3832EA5BEFD11E65.quest_desc: ["The Attack Titan is one of the Nine Titans known for its relentless pursuit of freedom. Throughout history, its inheritors have fought against oppression and refused to submit to control. This Titan possesses great strength, agility, and the unique ability to glimpse memories of future inheritors, allowing it to act with knowledge that transcends time."]
	quest.3832EA5BEFD11E65.quest_subtitle: "Attack Titan"
	quest.3C6E920FAC75BB6A.quest_desc: ["An upgraded propeller that provides more thrust than the standard version, increasing your aircraft's top speed."]
	quest.3E2FDFE3FEA7587E.quest_desc: ["Upgrades your plumbing to increase engine output and power by 10%."]
	quest.3F5142D8668B2A7C.quest_desc: ["An automatic, gyroscopic rapid-fire cannon that utilizes gunpowder as ammunition."]
	quest.41F0D9FD7AF067E4.quest_desc: ["A pedal-powered dual-seater that doesn't need fuel, but requires an initial push to spin the rotor."]
	quest.42B97C55E5CBFBC0.quest_desc: ["A powerful mounted weapon that fires arrows forcefully at enemies below."]
	quest.4683C8757BE5525D.quest_desc: ["A copper and bamboo seaplane equipped with 3 seats that can land on and take off directly from bodies of water."]
	quest.472BE54E70B688B1.quest_desc: ["Increases takeoff speed by 50%, making fixed-wing aircraft like the Biplane easier to get airborne in shorter distances."]
	quest.4B6C3865E36592F4.quest_desc: [
		"The Giant Forest is a dense woodland on Paradis Island filled with massive, towering trees that rise far above normal height. Its structure makes it ideal for ODM movement, allowing players to maneuver quickly between trunks while staying out of reach of Titans! In this biome you may find Iron Bamboo which is really necessary for items of the mod!"
		"{image:kubejs:block/aot23 width:100 height:50 align:center fit:true}"
	]
	quest.4B6C3865E36592F4.title: "Find Giant Forest"
	quest.4D648B1A24840C75.quest_desc: ["The structural body of larger aircraft. Crafted from logs and iron ingots, it's a required component for most aircraft recipes."]
	quest.5004B0FE8AE1DFEC.quest_desc: [
		"Right-click to consume and instantly randomize your current bloodline. Will you awaken as the &4&6Royal family&r&r or the fearsome &0Ackerman&r combat prowess. Or become a &4Eldian/subject of yimr&r? "
		"Take the gamble."
	]
	quest.508B6F33BA9FD644.quest_desc: ["“Paradis Island is a large, isolated island where many Eldians live behind three massive walls: Wall Maria, Wall Rose, and Wall Sina. For over a century, its people believed they were the last of humanity, protected from Titans outside the walls. In reality, Paradis was established by the Fritz royal family after the fall of the Eldian Empire.”"]
	quest.50DE7B3683A841AC.quest_desc: ["A large titan cut-out. Used for training purposes, can be powered with redstone."]
	quest.520A2150195C9FDB.quest_desc: [
		"the Hardened Furnace is necessary in the process of crafting ODM gear and the resources to craft it."
		"{image:kubejs:block/aot16 width:100 height:130 align:center fit:true}"
	]
	quest.52438EBC964AD0BA.quest_desc: [
		""
		"To be a Shifter you MUST be either Eldians/Subjects of Ymir or Royal"
		"and inject yourself with pure titan fluid near a Shifters"
		"(Keep in mind that when you are a pure titan you can’t control it so be wise)"
		""
		"Shifters also has their own stamina bar which determines if they can shift or if they are cooked in moments of danger!"
		""
		"Whenever that stamina bar reaches zero, you won’t be able to shift again for some time and if you are in your titan form when it reaches zero, you will get “ejected” from your titan and won’t be able to shift and get several effects for 30 seconds, this includes Darkness, Weakness V, Mining Fatigue V and Slowness"
		""
		"Titan stealth is a mechanic so no one in your server knows who the shifter is + it doesn’t make an explosion (for example  Colossal Titan Shifters ) and if you missclick like I always do so you don’t destroy your own house! (N by default)"
	]
	quest.535A2110925DD683.quest_desc: ["Zeke’s glasses are useful if you can’t find any Shifters Zeke’s Glasses highlights them so you can find them with ease and also adds +1 Armor, can be equipped in the head slot "]
	quest.548D13BF3A86AB02.quest_desc: [
		"“The Anti-Personnel Omni-Directional Mobility Gear is a set of equipment developed specifically to combat human opponents. The equipment itself is an adaptation of the traditional Omni-Directional Mobility Gear, allowing the operator the advantages of three-dimensional movement, but with the use of firearms instead of blades. It is virtually useless against Titans, but extremely effective against humans. It was secretly created by the Military Police's Anti-Personnel Control Squad specifically to combat the Scout Regiment.”"
		""
		"The Anti-Personnel ODM Gear is an equipment set that’s specially equipped for use in a PVP environment, mainly due to the fact that it cannot kill titans. Armed with two large guns, it can, (in testing,) nearly oneshot any player at point-blank range. The downside is that it has low accuracy, and burns through ammo quickly. It’s also pretty tedious to make, but I think that goes for practically every piece of armor in the mod."
	]
	quest.5675EA2FBB135B1B.quest_desc: ["A bulkier, high-capacity version of the standard airship, designed for transporting large amounts of goods."]
	quest.5844C89C8E1CA52A.quest_desc: [
		"To obtain the shifter powers from a villager you must hold right click while crouching with a syringe filled with Titan spinal fluid, you may use an empty syringe on a pure titan alive or dead to extract spinal fluid. After injecting yourself you will shift into a pure titan in which you have no control, thus it is recommended to shift near a villager so theres a better chance for it to be eaten. Once eaten you will gain its power."
		""
		"“Titan Shifters are Eldians who possess the power of one of the Nine Titans, allowing them to transform between human and Titan form at will. By inflicting a wound on themselves and focusing on a clear goal, they can trigger a transformation. Unlike Pure Titans, Shifters retain their intelligence and control over their Titan bodies. However, those who inherit a Titan power are bound by the Curse of Ymir, limiting their lifespan to 13 years after obtaining the power.”"
		"{image:kubejs:block/aot3 width:100 height:80 align:center fit:true}"
	]
	quest.5844C89C8E1CA52A.title: "Becoming a Shifter"
	quest.59E4335544154532.quest_desc: ["An aerial payload utility that drops tiny TNT packets for carpet-bombing enemies without destroying actual blocks"]
	quest.5AD9D0DDDAB592F6.quest_desc: ["The Armored Titan is one of the Nine Titans known for its immense durability and defensive power. Its body is covered in hardened armor plates that protect it from most attacks and allow it to break through walls and enemy defenses with brute force. Despite its heavy armor, it maintains strong physical strength and combat ability"]
	quest.5AD9D0DDDAB592F6.quest_subtitle: "Armored Titan"
	quest.5AD9D0DDDAB592F6.title: "Armored Titan"
	quest.5B5607DE3C888872.quest_desc: ["A fast, single-seat aircraft that requires a runway to take off but is perfect for rapid transit."]
	quest.5DD9FA76C9D34E73.quest_desc: ["Slay a titan with ODM gear"]
	quest.63AF03085F5C872D.quest_desc: ["The gas canister is only used to refill the gas in the ODM gear when you run out of it so to refill it you must first have Ice Burst cluster in your inventory and M2 to refill it, to fill the canister you will need 20 ice burst cluster and shift+M2 to fill your odm!"]
	quest.65EC1023B6E9C360.quest_desc: [
		"Thunder Spears are specialized anti-Titan weapons used by soldiers equipped with ODM gear. They are explosive rocket-like spears designed to pierce and detonate through hardened Titan armor, making them especially effective against enemies like the Armored Titan."
		""
		"After attaching to a target, the spear explodes with enough force to destroy heavily protected Titan napes or armored defenses."
		""
		"To use the thunder spears you will need the ODM Gear and ODM Grips"
		"then (by default shift and V) to reload and to fire them (Shift and M1 and M2 by default) or when you shoot them just grapple somewhere and move for them to explode ."
		"Make sure to aim to the eyes or the nape! (and keep in mind that they are a bit expensive to craft lol)"
	]
	quest.69AB8775EFE10F75.quest_desc: [
		"The flare gun is used to fire the cartridges with different meaning, the ones in the mod and their meaning are the following:"
		"Red flare-Titan Spotted"
		"Black Flare-Abnormal Spotted"
		"Purple Flare- Emergency"
		"Blue Flare-Retreat"
		"Green flare- Change direction"
		"Yellow Flare- Mission Terminated"
	]
	quest.6A3126E2E8EEC236.quest_desc: [
		"“ODM Gear (Omni-Directional Mobility Gear) is specialized equipment used by soldiers to move freely in three dimensions during combat. By firing grappling hooks and using gas-powered propulsion, users can rapidly maneuver through buildings, trees, and terrain at high speed. This mobility allows soldiers to outmaneuver Titans and strike their weak point at the nape. ODM gear is primarily used by the Survey Corps, the Garrison Regiment, and the Military Police Brigade.”"
		""
		"“ODM (Omni-Directional Mobility) Movement is a combat technique that uses specialized gear to allow soldiers to move freely in three dimensions. By firing grappling hooks and using gas-powered propulsion, users can rapidly maneuver through the air, buildings, and terrain. This mobility is essential for fighting Titans, allowing soldiers to reach their weak point at the nape while maintaining high speed and agility.”"
		""
		"By equipping the ODM gear in the leggings slot and one ODM grip in both hands you will be able to hook to either structures or titans and even players! to hook to any structure or titan you must aim to them and pressing the correct keybinds (G for left hook and H for right hook by default) after using the hooks you must press space for a gas boost but don’t use it too often! or… you might just end up like some certain characters"
		"{image:kubejs:block/aot17 width:100 height:50 align:center fit:true}"
		"{image:kubejs:block/aot18 width:100 height:50 align:center fit:true}"
	]
	quest.6AEE8400D9901091.quest_desc: ["The spinning apparatus that generates thrust, crafted from iron ingots."]
	quest.6EED5303477F1224.quest_desc: ["A stabilization device that completely eliminates the effects of wind pushing your aircraft off-course."]
	quest.6F758BE7D9D16A43.quest_desc: ["Used for lighter-than-air flight, made with white carpet and string."]
	quest.71A53C8A9ADF422E.quest_desc: ["Iron Bamboo, important if you want to craft most of the stuff on this mod, it can be found in the giant forests randomly sooo you will spend some time finding"]
	quest.7207E63C9B2BF308.quest_desc: ["The power source for fuel-burning aircraft. Built from a Boiler, Cobblestone, a Blast Furnace, and Pistons."]
	quest.7229AADE396EC5E8.quest_desc: [
		"The docks can be found ONLY in the overworld and work just like any other portal to reach."
		"they spawn randomly in the overworld after finding the docks you must go to the center torch where you will find a portal. After jumping in it you will reach the dimension of Paradis!"
		"{image:kubejs:block/aot5 width:100 height:80 align:center fit:true}"
	]
	quest.7229AADE396EC5E8.title: "Find Dock"
	quest.73A2C35972D76FE4.quest_desc: ["Adds a heads-up display showing flight orientation and stability data while piloting, helping you stay oriented."]
	quest.74DEEE8DD5340E9A.quest_desc: [" A slower, two-seater blimp that is very easy to maneuver and includes acceptable speed from its rear engine."]
	quest.7642412AE8F9A43B.quest_desc: ["A zoomable scout tool offering twice the magnification of a vanilla spyglass, mounted directly onto your aircraft."]
	quest.7744DBF4726F279E.quest_desc: [
		"The Armor Potion is a rare item that can be found in the Reiss Chapel structure. Shifters that drink it will obtain the hardening ability.   "
		""
		"The reiss chapel is a small structure which can be found ONLY in titan’s highland biome you may find useful loot inside it, currently there’s no crystal cave underneath it, might be added in the future!"
	]
	quest.77A90EC58B88DB09.quest_desc: [
		"Ultrahard Steel Ingots might be one of the most expensive resources in the whole mod, since you will need Hardened Iron Bamboo"
		"Iron Ingot and Hardened Furnace"
		"Making it a bit hard to get if you are kind of new to the mod"
	]
	quest.79FDC1E621D60895.quest_desc: [
		"“Military uniforms are worn by soldiers serving within the forces of Paradis Island. These uniforms are designed for mobility and protection while using ODM gear in combat against Titans. Each regiment wears a similar base uniform with different insignias to represent their division, such as the Survey Corps, the Garrison Regiment, and the Military Police Brigade. The uniform typically includes a short jacket, harnesses for ODM gear, boots, and cloaks bearing each regiment’s symbol.”"
		""
		"Yes! this mod includes the uniforms so you can wear them and dedicate your heart for humanity’s sake!"
		"The uniforms can only be equipped on the body slot and adds 3+ armor to the player."
	]
	quest.7E9459246FFD6AF3.quest_desc: [
		"“Eldian is the official language of Eldia, Marley, and many other nations around the world. As a result of the old Eldian Empires's imperialism, Eldian is a well known language throughout the world. It is spoken both inside and outside the Walls, although their writing systems differ.”"
		""
		"Canned Herring is a food item that can be found in the Utgard Castle structure. Normally, the nametag is a random jumble of letters and numbers. The text can only be decoded by shifters and those of Marleyan blood. Can be opened with shears."
	]
	reward.7AD4F31CE68D7DE3.title: "/daot bloodline set @s eldian"
